  "identityStatus": "Paired independent ways361503808 and361503809 identify the entrance to Yasnaya Polyana. Retained mapped centers are5.229m apart along northeast/southwest; X northeast across the pair, Z southeast toward the outside approach, baked native axes with heading0 at the unchanged assigned collection anchor in the passage. Outside and inside photos establish green bell roofs, white cylinders and estate-facing northwest arched doors. PMTiles envelopes are broad relative to the photographed spacing: preserve both centers/ownership outlines while using photo-led slim bodies at60% of equivalent map radius, about1.8..1.92m diameter. This is an explicit map/photo reconciliation, not an exact surveyed footprint. Wing walls extend only outward, preserving the passage.",
